  geometry: l1d_sets=128, l1d_ways=8, l2_sets=1024, l2_ways=8, llc_sets=1024, llc_ways=8
    because: LLC has a very low hit rate across all workloads, meaning its 15-cycle hit latency is paid on almost every access only to miss anyway; shrinking it to 512 KB reduces this penalty to 9 cycles.
